# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:7
translate turkish u19a1s9_9854c7a0:

    # "The next day, I wake early and they already have traveling gear ready for me, complete with a sword that I have no idea how to use."
    "Ertesi gün erken uyanıyorum ve benim için seyahat eşyaları çoktan hazırlanmış; nasıl kullanılacağını hiç bilmediğim bir kılıç da dahil."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:8
translate turkish u19a1s9_01bc3348:

    # dad "Hopefully you won't need it, but there are bandits and raiders along the road."
    dad "Umarım ihtiyacın olmaz, ama yol boyunca haydutlar ve yağmacılar var."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:9
translate turkish u19a1s9_38beaaf3:

    # joan "And worse."
    joan "Ve daha kötüsü."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:10
translate turkish u19a1s9_09268dc8:

    # pc "Worse? How worse?"
    pc "Daha kötüsü mü? Ne kadar kötü?"

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:13
translate turkish u19a1s9_5af67db8:

    # joan "You... are going... to die."
    joan "Sen... öleceksin."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:14
translate turkish u19a1s9_b669ce15:

    # rm "Oh hush, Joan. It's not that bad out there."
    rm "Hadi sus, Joan. Dışarısı o kadar da kötü değil."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:15
translate turkish u19a1s9_9d89cbcd:

    # dad "If anybody tries to rob you, just give them whatever they want."
    dad "Biri seni soymaya kalkışırsa, ne isterlerse ver gitsin."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:16
translate turkish u19a1s9_6858bb39:

    # pc "Yeah... okay."
    pc "Evet... tamam."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:19
translate turkish u19a1s9_c8f788db:

    # rm "I put some food in your pack for the journey. The trip is going to take you a few days, so try to ration it."
    rm "Yolculuk için çantana biraz yiyecek koydum. Yolculuk birkaç gün sürecek, o yüzden idareli kullanmaya çalış."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:20
translate turkish u19a1s9_7e877b4e:

    # pc "Okay, thanks Mo... ma'am."
    pc "Tamam, teşekkürler Mo... hanımefendi."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:23
translate turkish u19a1s9_edf04c3d:

    # rm "You can call me Mom. It's okay."
    rm "Bana anne diyebilirsin. Sorun değil."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:26
translate turkish u19a1s9_41da4e2f:

    # joan "It's kind of weird."
    joan "Biraz tuhaf geliyor."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:29
translate turkish u19a1s9_fe431afe:

    # rm "Kind of weird is okay."
    rm "Biraz tuhaf olması sorun değil."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:32
translate turkish u19a1s9_8ca102bb:

    # dad "Good luck, [pcname]. If you need to come back, we will be here for you."
    dad "İyi şanslar, [pcname]. Geri dönmen gerekirse, biz burada olacağız."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:33
translate turkish u19a1s9_6c99ffd7:

    # pc "I don't think I'll be coming back."
    pc "Sanırım geri dönmeyeceğim."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:34
translate turkish u19a1s9_3dc7d8ff:

    # dad "I know."
    dad "Biliyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:35
translate turkish u19a1s9_0445458c:

    # dad "It was good seeing you. Take care of yourself. And good luck... with everything."
    dad "Seni görmek güzeldi. Kendine iyi bak. Ve her şeyde... iyi şanslar."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:38
translate turkish u19a1s9_8936a5ca:

    # dad "I love you, Son."
    dad "Seni seviyorum, oğlum."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:39
translate turkish u19a1s9_2077d21a:

    # pc "I love you too, Dad."
    pc "Ben de seni seviyorum, baba."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:42
translate turkish u19a1s9_ceb48045:

    # rm "Bye, [pcname]. It was nice to meet you."
    rm "Hoşça kal, [pcname]. Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:43
translate turkish u19a1s9_083936bd:

    # joan "Yeah, bye! It was {i}really{/i} nice."
    joan "Evet, hoşça kal! {i}Gerçekten{/i} güzeldi."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:44
translate turkish u19a1s9_73dbe01c:

    # pc "Bye, Joan."
    pc "Hoşça kal, Joan."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:45
translate turkish u19a1s9_7f426c31:

    # pc "Bye, Mom."
    pc "Hoşça kal, anne."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:48
translate turkish u19a1s9_c5f90603:

    # "It's hard, but I turn and walk away, leaving both of my parents behind, knowing that I will likely never see them again."
    "Zor geliyor ama arkamı dönüp uzaklaşıyorum, her iki ebeveynimi de geride bırakarak, muhtemelen onları bir daha asla göremeyeceğimi bilerek."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:49
translate turkish u19a1s9_12188131:

    # "But I also know that I have other people waiting in {i}my{/i} world for me and the thought of not seeing those people again is even worse."
    "Ama aynı zamanda {i}benim{/i} dünyamda beni bekleyen başka insanlar olduğunu da biliyorum ve o insanları bir daha görememe düşüncesi daha da kötü."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:52
translate turkish u19a1s9_74dfd708:

    # "So I don't look back as I walk north, with my pack and my sword."
    "Bu yüzden sırt çantam ve kılıcımla kuzeye doğru yürürken arkama bakmıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act1/act1scene9.rpy:53
translate turkish u19a1s9_253c2be3:

    # "Into an unknown world filled with unknown dangers, hoping that I'll see my home again."
    "Bilinmeyen tehlikelerle dolu bilinmeyen bir dünyaya doğru, evimi tekrar göreceğimi umarak."

